Error [E0211]: `CellReadGuard<Int>` can't be copied
  --> tests/ui/local_cell_guard_copy.jet:4:15
    |
  4 |     copied :: ~guard
    |               ^^^^^^
 Why: a Cell guard owns one live dynamic loan; copying it would create two handles for the same loan
 Fix: move it instead with the move-capability marker `^` (`^guard`), or create a new guard after this one is dropped
